    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beefarena</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Beefarena, a wild roguelike ride through an alien invasion of mutant cattle!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Volunteer for Megga Corps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enlist in Megga Corps today for your chance at glory! Confront the herd in over 150 arenas spanning 8 randomized biomes-- No two tours of duty are ever the same. Do you have what it takes to wrangle this invasion force and liberate earth?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Build Your Arsenal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your weapon locker with the dozens of weapons you find in combat and enhance your firepower with items available in Megga Corp vending machines, conveniently located near the hottest invasion sites! Use weapons like the\u00a0flamethrower,\u00a0chainsaw, and\u00a0electrifying cattle prod!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Round up Your Posse</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring a friend and battle together with couch co-op! At any time a second player can pick up a controller and jump into the action with the press of a button. Recruit your most skilled allies to bring liberation to earths homesteads, or get someone to bait all those heat seeking rockets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beefarena</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Beefarena, a wild roguelike ride through an alien invasion of mutant cattle!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Volunteer for Megga Corps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enlist in Megga Corps today for your chance at glory! Confront the herd in over 150 arenas spanning 8 randomized biomes-- No two tours of duty are ever the same. Do you have what it takes to wrangle this invasion force and liberate earth?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Build Your Arsenal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your weapon locker with the dozens of weapons you find in combat and enhance your firepower with items available in Megga Corp vending machines, conveniently located near the hottest invasion sites! Use weapons like the\u00a0flamethrower,\u00a0chainsaw, and\u00a0electrifying cattle prod!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Round up Your Posse</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring a friend and battle together with couch co-op! At any time a second player can pick up a controller and jump into the action with the press of a button. Recruit your most skilled allies to bring liberation to earths homesteads, or get someone to bait all those heat seeking rockets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "A 2d platformer sh'mup in a roguelike package. Fight co-op through randomized runs constructed from hundreds of arenas full of secrets and explosive loot!",
